# Local development needs nothing here: the Vite dev server forwards /api to the Mon-Ecole-Backend API
# on http://localhost:8000 (set VITE_PROXY_TARGET in your shell to use another address).
#
# Production builds (Cloudflare Workers): full API URL, set as a build variable on the mon-ecole Worker. Leave unset to call /api/v1 on the same origin (the Docker image does this).
# VITE_API_URL=https://api.example.org/api/v1
